== Effects ==
* Upon use, causes Isaac to lose half a heart of [[health]] (or a full heart in [[Chapter 4]] onward) while spawning [[coin]]s.
** {{dlc|nr}} Each use pays out with 1-2 coins.
** {{Dlc|r}} Each use pays out with 1-2 coins on Normal mode or 1 coin on [[Hard mode]].
** IV Bag takes {{e|Red Heart}}s before other heart types.

== Notes ==
* This item can be found when causing a {{machine|Blood Donation Machine}} to explode by donating Hearts to it.
* This effect is counted as inflicted damage for items that spawn [[pickup]]s upon said inflicted damage, such as {{i|Gimpy}} or {{i|Fanny Pack}}, but does not decrease the chance of encountering the {{r|Devil Room}} / {{r|Angel Room}}.
* Can be used before taking damage (getting hit, walking over spikes, going through a {{r|Curse Room}}, etc.) to grant coins without inflicting extra damage.
** {{dlc|nr}} Also allows Isaac to avoid damage taken by using a {{machine|Blood Donation Machine}} or {{machine|Devil Beggar}}.
* Using this item as {{C|The Lost}} or while in the Lost form after touching the {{E|White Fire Place}} kills Isaac.

== Synergies ==
* {{Book of Belial synergy|description=Gives a temporary +0.66 damage up with each use.}}
* {{Book of Virtues synergy|description=Spawns wisps in the outer ring, resembling coins. The wisps only have one health.}}
* {{dlc+|nr}} {{i|Isaac's Heart}}: Can be used without taking damage, resulting in an infinite amount of coins.
** {{dlc|a}} Isaac still takes damage from this during {{chal|The Guardian}}.{{dlc-}}
* {{i|PHD}}:
** {{dlc|nr}} Increases each payout to 2-3 coins.
** {{dlc|r}} Increases each payout to 2-3 coins on Normal mode and 2 on [[Hard mode]].
* {{i|Portable Slot}}: Can be alternated between to gain ridiculous amounts of [[pickups]] from only a few initial coins or hearts.
* {{dlc|nr}} {{i|Scapular}}: Allows for infinite coins once Isaac is at half a red heart (or full red heart in [[Chapter 4]] onward) by moving between rooms to reset Scapular's effect.
* {{c|Keeper}} / {{c|Tainted Keeper}}: Spawns 0-1 coins instead.

== Interactions ==
* [[Invulnerability]] and [[shield]]s can't be used to prevent damage from IV Bag, even if it normally prevents damage from a {{M|Blood Donation Machine}}.
* {{I|Car Battery}}: No effect.
* {{t|Cracked Dice}}: Rerolls the coins generated by IV bag, and can be used to generate unlimited pickups and items.
* {{dlc|a}} {{i|Holy Mantle}} and similar items: IV Bag ignores the shield's protection, resulting in Isaac taking damage regardless.

